---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Writes a consistent Postgres custom-format backup. Copy it off-site

Usage: leptoskit infra backup [OPTIONS] --out <OUT>

Options:
      --out <OUT>  New output file; never overwrites an existing backup
      --upload     Also upload the completed archive to the private backup bucket. Uses `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID/AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY` scoped to that bucket
  -h, --help       Print help
  -V, --version    Print version
